WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.340
(SINGING) Last night
I was lost in time--

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.570
Excuse me, Mr. Reeves?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.190
I noticed I didn't
get a callback.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.420
Look, you're just not the right
kind of girl for this show.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.220
But--

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.320
(SINGING) Like a movie in my--

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.090
I don't want you to quit
when things get hard.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.930
You're talented, you're smart.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.186
You can do anything.

00:00:16.186 --> 00:00:18.000
(SINGING) When I look out--

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.590
Your song is blowing up.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:20.940
You should see the
reactions online.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.410
"I'm so sick of
wannabe pop stars."

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.190
Is that it?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.500
He's probably just
some dumb online troll.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.200
Didn't stop five
people from liking it.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.710
[GASPS]
[SCREAMING]

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.715
(SINGING) Remember there's--

00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:33.640
You're the amazing Holly Hobbie.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.320
You need to take control
of the narrative.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.200
What are you doing?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.390
Signing up.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.620
OK.
See you there.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.420
See ya.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.620
[CHEERING]

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.720
(SINGING) You and I --

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:47.920
Now introducing,
singer-songwriter Holly Hobbie.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.620
(SINGING) Remember that
there's more to life.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:51.820
[CHEERING]

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.420
Now, that is beautiful.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.820
(SINGING) Remember
there's more to life.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:59.274
[CHEERING]

